y"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with older versions, the sign attribute is yes by default if the line attribute is no, and is no by default if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the line attribute is yes. If the sign attribute is set to yes and the type is start or sostenuto, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"abbreviated attribute is yes if the short P and S signs are used, and no if the full Ped and Sost signs are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used. It is no by default. Otherwise the abbreviated attribute is ignored. The alignment attributes are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored if the sign attribute is no."}],"title":"MXLPedal","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal"}}}